# Rubbery bone: what a chalk stand-in can and cannot prove
# Acid removes carbonate from chalk. Real bone is calcium phosphate in collagen;
# chalk is not bone, and flexibility is not modeled.
register lv1
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 chalk_stick 2g
look v1
new beaker
add v2 white_vinegar_5_percent 50mL
add v2 chalk_stick 2g
look v2
